    "updated_at": "2025-01-16T16:37:59Z",
    "body": "Returning \"inherit\" means people would need a solution to #7039 (or use existing methods for looking up direction via traversal).  Fortunately all browsers push it into the computed style value for direction.\n\nI guess this is more of an issue for \"lang\" which really is a complicated mess to extract right now.",
